text.section:
Each person accepting a purchase order for a delivery sale shall comply with:

The age verification requirements set forth in § 18.2-246.8;


The disclosure requirements set forth in § 18.2-246.9;


The shipping requirements set forth in § 18.2-246.10;


The registration and reporting requirements set forth in § 18.2-246.11;


The tax collection requirements set forth in § 18.2-246.12; and


All other laws of the Commonwealth generally applicable to sales of cigarettes that occur entirely within the Commonwealth, including, but not limited to, those laws imposing: (i) excise taxes, (ii) sales taxes, and (iii) license and revenue-stamping requirements.
